    "waitTime": 1000
  },
  {
    "id": 2007012010180,
    "label": "2",
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "うーん、あったといえばそうなんだけど、\r\n自分では別にそこまで困ってるつもりじゃなくてね",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200701201/2007012010180"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あー……！　そっか、悪い……！\r\n無理に聞きたいわけじゃ……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007012010190,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "いやいや\r\n気にかけてくれてありがとう、だし",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_close6",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200701201/2007012010190"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007012010200,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "……でもちょっと自信はなくしちゃうな～\r\n切り替えたはずだったのに気付かれちゃうとか",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_jito",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
